53	// region check, the provisioning reconciler, then the mirror-done /
54	// perms-backfill / verified-email consumers when NATS built them (NATS is
55	// required at boot in regional mode, so in practice all three are present),
56	// the org-invitation token sweep, the detach cleanup relay, and the
57	// cascade-delete finisher.
58	//
59	// The reconciler is unconditional here: regional always wires a full
60	// JurisdictionCapabilities group (buildJurisdictionCaps in api_server.go), so
61	// provisioningReconcilerSubsystem's nil-caps guard never trips in practice.
62	// RunReconciler's own point-of-use check (the unwired-RepoBridge case)
63	// preserves the warn-and-skip behavior if the bridge is ever unconfigured.
